    "detailed_description": "Seeking Light is an action adventure game in isometric perspective with a focus on boss fights.  <br>Take control of Sunny, a girl immersed in her subconscious world through meditation where she will have to face her fears in order to leave behind all the pain from the past.<br><br><strong>Breath in\u2026 Breath out\u2026 Ready?</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/7a60b424e12ec0e734be1e797f48ca57.webp?t=1720040301\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/90b48ce2d4d8b16c0c97c9df90b87a97.poster.avif?t=1720040301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/90b48ce2d4d8b16c0c97c9df90b87a97.webm?t=1720040301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/90b48ce2d4d8b16c0c97c9df90b87a97.mp4?t=1720040301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/050d9cc8a97ca1aede1eae8982180c81.webp?t=1720040301\" /></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">USE YOUR ENVIRONMENT TO FIGHT</h2></strong><br>Break pillars to get broken stones, pick up bombs and jumping platforms to help yourself through the levels.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BE BRAVE, LITTLE GIRL!</h2></strong><br>Explore your inner world and collect the pieces of your childhood diary to confront the causes of your fears.  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/7a60b424e12ec0e734be1e797f48ca57.webp?t=1720040301\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/c4d0cbd6174c0838e11611ae56ea6669.poster.avif?t=1720040301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/c4d0cbd6174c0838e11611ae56ea6669.webm?t=1720040301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/c4d0cbd6174c0838e11611ae56ea6669.mp4?t=1720040301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/050d9cc8a97ca1aede1eae8982180c81.webp?t=1720040301\" /></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES: </h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tightly tuned controls. Dash, attack and throw objects to defeat your fears.<br></li><li> Five world zones with their own identity and theme.<br></li><li> Five unique boss fights.<br></li><li> Collect pages of Sunny's diary to discover the details of her past. <br></li><li> Solve puzzles and explore the world of Sunny\u2019s inner mind.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/7a60b424e12ec0e734be1e797f48ca57.webp?t=1720040301\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/47b1dfa98969b97442b339a0ae4ff20d.avif?t=1720040301\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/f40d08699d9f9c1613d64e37532de15f.avif?t=1720040301\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986790/extras/d88274ff818ce8aa19fe69d78bbf0f35.avif?t=1720040301\" /></div><br><div class=\"b